If you have not unlocked a [[port]]:
:''"You will first need to reach a port city before you are able to travel to Embark Beach. These cities are Lion's Arch, Kaineng Center, and Kamadan, Jewel of Istan."''
If you have unlocked a port:
:''"There are many threats in this world, and it is dangerous to face them alone, friend. If you seek allies, perhaps you will find them at '''Embark Beach'''. Do you wish to travel there?"''
::'''{{yes}} Yes, please take me  to Embark Beach.'''
